<p><h2>**2 down, 2 to go**</h2>
<p>
<i>Rain seems harmless, but really, its the toughest of them all</i><br>
--Homeless Nimbus Guy

<p>You are moving your island to go and find RAINDOR the rain master, when you find your boss, General Thunder is outnumbered by two Rain Beasts and the master himself, RAINDOR.  You go into warp speed and realize that your brakes were damaged in the last battle with the Wind demons.  You fly full speed ahead straight into General Thunder, sending your priest flying off your island into the crossfire of the battle, save your priest first, then kick some rain butt, and remember, RAINDOR dies, all the rain guys dissapear.  

